Task: Return the last id. The array has n cells, starting at index 0.
Signature: int last_beacon(int ids[], int n)

Student code:
```c
// helper function to get the last element from an array
int get_last_element(int arr[], int size) { // helper function starts here
    // the last element is stored at index size
    return (arr[size]); // return the last element
} // helper function ends here
// required function to return the last of n beacon ids
int last_beacon(int ids[], int n) { // required function starts here
    // call helper to get the last value from ids
    int last = (get_last_element(ids, n)); // store the last value in last
    return (last); // return the last value
} // required function ends here
```
